This licence covers only the work added to this container by the FaMAF CVA6
Project. Every path below is a path inside the container:

  - scripts/                 the run drivers, the two sweeps, the parity check,
                             the patch tool, the batch JSON converter, the
                             cleaner and the viewer server
  - gem5_configs/            the MinorCPU configurations matched to CVA6, their
                             calibration harnesses, the configurations used
                             while developing the viewer and the frozen paper
                             copy
  - benchmarks/config/       the calibration programs, written for the CVA6
                             comparison
  - benchmarks/viewer/       the programs written while developing the viewer
  - MinorFlow/               the MinorFlow viewer and its tracer, offered under
                             this same MIT licence in its own repository at
                             https://github.com/FaMAF-CVA6-Project/MinorFlow
  - README.md                the documentation written for this container

  - gem5_configs/config/MinorCPU_CVA6.patch
                             PARTLY, and only the changes. The patch is a set of
                             changes to gem5's own sources: the changes are this
                             project's, and every file they produce stays gem5's
                             work under gem5's licence. The patch is applied in
                             the tree of this container, so src/ here is gem5's
                             code with those changes in it.

It does not cover gem5. gem5 is the work of the gem5 developers and
contributors and stays under its own terms, preserved in this container as
LICENSE and COPYING, with its own documentation as README.gem5.md.

It does not cover the RISC-V toolchain either, which comes from the
distribution's packages and stays under its own terms.

